                                "sense_id": "84050ce9-0bda-398a-baae-3511e796d9d7",
                                "text": "As Max Millikan ruefully noted, “The only prophet without a significant Indonesian following is probably Adam Smith”.",
                                "translation": "Comme Max Millikan le notait tristement, « Le seul prophète ayant peu de disciples indonésiens est probablement Adam Smith » ."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0dcc1825-0f36-48a6-bb48-de96a4bbca45",
                                "sense_id": "84050ce9-0bda-398a-baae-3511e796d9d7",
                                "text": "The lady shook her head ruefully, and the Professor laughed loudly and stroked his beard in his masterful fashion.",
                                "translation": "La dame secoua la tête tristement, et le Professeur s'exclaffa et caressa sa barbe de façon magistrale."
